  "meta": {
    "description": "WhatsApp -> POST /api/whatsapp/chat -> reply. n8n carries messages only: it holds no chat history and no database credentials, because the app looks up this sender's WhatsApp history by phone number and saves both sides itself. WhatsApp history is kept separate from website chat. The app answers 200 even when it fails, with success:false and the real error, so the customer always gets a sentence while the failure still shows red in n8n and is written to the whatsapp_logs table against this execution id. Before activating: set the two WhatsApp credentials, and replace REPLACE_WITH_WHATSAPP_WEBHOOK_SECRET in 'Ask the App' with the value of WHATSAPP_WEBHOOK_SECRET from the app's environment."
  }
